$ Unified-dialect demonstration: STEELMAKING in one database.
$
$ Basic steel (Fe-C after Gustafson 1985 on Dinsdale unaries, as in FeC.tdb,
$ with the Inden-Hillert-Jarl magnetic BCC and FCC) together with the open
$ FeO-MgO-SiO2 slag assessment shipped as web/FeO-MgO-SiO2-combined.dat: the
$ MQMQA slag liquid, the olivine and orthopyroxene solid solutions, and the
$ oxide solids. Steel and its slag share iron in one file; no legacy container
$ can hold this pairing. Carried by the uTDB extension statements (:Q phase,
$ MQG/MQZETA/MQSTOI/MQZ/MQX; see docs/UNIFIED_TDB_SPEC.md); the round-trip
$ test asserts both halves agree with their source files at machine precision.
$ CC BY-SA 4.0 like the rest of the data in this repository.
$
 ELEMENT /-   ELECTRON_GAS              0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
 ELEMENT VA   VACUUM                    0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
 ELEMENT FE   BCC_A2                    5.5847E+01  4.4890E+03  2.7280E+01 !
 ELEMENT C    GRAPHITE                  1.2011E+01  1.0540E+03  5.7400E+00 !
 ELEMENT MG   HCP_A3                    2.4305E+01  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
 ELEMENT SI   DIA_A4                    2.8085E+01  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
 ELEMENT O    GAS_1/2_MOLE_O2           1.5999E+01  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !

 SPECIES FE+2   FE1/+2 !
 SPECIES MG+2   MG1/+2 !
 SPECIES SI+4   SI1/+4 !
 SPECIES O-2    O1/-2 !
 SPECIES FEO    FE1O1 !
 SPECIES MGO    MG1O1 !
 SPECIES SIO2   SI1O2 !

